#: ../../source/compliance.rst:225 22e753688d8c441fada40a3d5cdb64d3
msgid "Known gaps"
msgstr ""
"已知缺口"

#: ../../source/compliance.rst:227 ad1c5c483e3644c1af52773cbdf4133d
msgid ""
"Three things are unresolved on purpose, and each costs the sentence it "
"blocks:"
msgstr ""
"有三件事是被刻意留作未决的，每一件都要付掉它所挡住的那句话："

#: ../../source/compliance.rst:229 809e69eb8da94151868d50aee2aa1572
msgid ""
"**The snapshot can age.** ``tool-checks.txt`` is a copy, and the tool "
"installed here resolves more check names than the copy lists. Re-"
"snapshotting would file rows for checks no gate runs, which is the defect"
" this page exists to prevent, so the enforced set is read from the family"
" table and the snapshot keeps its older meaning. The decision to re-"
"snapshot is open."
msgstr ""
"**快照会变旧。** ``tool-checks.txt`` 是一份副本，而这里安装的工具解析出"
"的检查名比副本列出的更多。重新快照会为没有门禁运行的检查记下行，那正是本"
"页存在的目的所要防的缺陷，所以被强制的集合从族表读，快照保留它较早的含义"
"。是否重新快照这一决定仍然敞开。"

#: ../../source/compliance.rst:234 b94e40286d1e46c0adc39a60b673eb47
msgid ""
"**No mapping from a check to a MISRA rule number.** Every count on this "
"page is a count of checks or of units, not of rules in a named standard. "
"The rule numbers are the ``misra-rule-mapping`` row of the ``open`` "
"register."
msgstr ""
"**没有从检查到 MISRA 规则号的映射。** 本页上的每个计数都是检查或单元的计"
"数，不是具名标准里规则的计数。规则号是 ``open`` 登记册里的 ``"
"misra-rule-mapping`` 行。"

#: ../../source/compliance.rst:237 9367c536d5e949d9a3d6391f96bb92ca
msgid ""
"**Two delivery forms exist and are not claimed.** "
"``.github/project/forms.json`` registers the FMU and the Python module "
"with ``claim_status: gap`` and writes the gap out: no claim row describes"
" the FMU (it has a runnable demonstration -- a standard master loads it "
"and drives the loop -- but no level, no boundary statement and no \"what "
"it does not claim\"), and Python appears only as an evidence path on "
"three rows, never as a claim that the binding behaves. The page therefore"
" says \"a form exists\" and not \"a form is supported\"."
msgstr ""
"**存在两种交付形态，且未被主张。** ``.github/project/forms.json`` 以 ``"
"claim_status: gap`` 登记 FMU 与 Python 模块，并把缺口写出来：没有主张行"
"描述 FMU（它有一个可运行的演示——一个标准主站加载它并驱动该环——但没有等级"
"、没有边界声明、也没有“它不主张什么”），而 Python 只作为三行上的证据路径"
"出现，从未作为“该绑定行为正确”的主张出现。因此本页说的是“有一种形态存在”"
"，而不是“有一种形态被支持”。"

#: ../../source/compliance.rst:247 10c3d35a23d5459fa902deac19f87430
msgid ""
"``workspace/`` is not in version control by design: it holds internal "
"material. The consequence is that the ledger is not part of what a "
"customer receives -- but the rule table, the deviation permits and the "
"summary are, because they live in ``.github/project/compliance/``."
msgstr ""
"``workspace/`` 按设计不在版本控制里：它存放内部材料。后果是台账不属于客"
"户收到的东西——但规则表、偏离许可与汇总属于，因为它们住在 ``"
".github/project/compliance/`` 里。"

